<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#0B1220', padding: '20px 64px' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 100, borderLeft: '6px solid #38BDF8', paddingLeft: 18, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E5EDF7' }}>两种使用方式</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32, alignItems: 'stretch' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '46%', gap: 14 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#16203A', borderRadius: 12, padding: 20, borderTop: '3px solid #38BDF8', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E5EDF7' }}>方式一 · IDE 内聊天客户端</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>如已购 GitHub Copilot / Claude 许可，在 IDE 内配置 LLM 端点。<Text style={{ color: '#E5EDF7' }}>适合开发者、高级用户、CI/CD 与多步工作流。</Text></Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#16203A', borderRadius: 12, padding: 20, borderTop: '3px solid #F97316', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E5EDF7' }}>方式二 · CANoe 内置 AI 助手</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>聊天窗口直接嵌在 CANoe 中。<Text style={{ color: '#E5EDF7' }}>适合不使用 VS Code、主要工作在 CANoe 上的人与 AI 新手。</Text></Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: 'rgba(56,189,248,0.08)', borderRadius: 12, padding: 20, borderLeft: '4px solid #38BDF8', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#38BDF8' }}>怎么选？</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 6 }}>重自动化、要跑 CI/CD → 方式一；只想在 CANoe 里随手问 → 方式二。两者共用同一套代理与 MCP 能力。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '54%', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
      <Box style={{ height: 348, background: '#16203A', borderRadius: 12, padding: 12, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Image src="assets/harness_llm.png" style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', objectFit: 'contain' }} />
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#16203A', borderRadius: 12, padding: 16, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>图：AI 运行时（harness）承载 LLM——在 CANoe 内或 IDE 中，接入你自己的 LLM 端点。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>Vector CANoe AI · 研讨会分享</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>09 / 23</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
